NIVEAU = 1
AIDE1 = 'TELEMAC-3D offers the possibility to perform mass-lumping on H. This gathers all or part (given the value of the coefficient) of the AM1(H) matrices on their diagonal. This technique can speed-up the code a lot and also render it more stable. Yet, the solutions are smoothened. This parameter sets the mass-lumping amount done for H.'
/
