RUBRIQUE = 'TURBULENCE';'NUMERICAL PARAMETERS';'ADVECTION'
RUBRIQUE1 = 'TURBULENCE';'NUMERICAL PARAMETERS';'ADVECTION'
NIVEAU = 1
AIDE1 = 'Sets the advection scheme for the k-ε model or Spalart-Allmaras model. Possible choices are: • 0: no convection, • 1: characteristics, • 2: SUPG, • 3: Leo Postma scheme, • 4: MURD scheme N, – SCHEME OPTION FOR ADVECTION OF VELOCITIES/TRACERS/K-EPSILON): ∗ 1: classical explicit scheme; ∗ 2: 1st order predictor-corrector; ∗ 3: 2nd order predictor-corrector; ∗ 4: implicit scheme compatible with tidal flats; – NUMBER OF CORRECTIONS OF DISTRIBUTIVE SCHEMES: sets the number of sub-iterations for the 1st and 2nd order predictor-corrector schemes (a value around 4 is recommended). • 5: MURD scheme PSI, – SCHEME OPTION FOR ADVECTION OF VELOCITIES/TRACERS/K-EPSILON): ∗ 1: classical explicit scheme; ∗ 2: 1st order predictor-corrector; ∗ 3: 2nd order predictor-corrector; ∗ 4: implicit scheme compatible with tidal flats; – NUMBER OF CORRECTIONS OF DISTRIBUTIVE SCHEMES: sets the number of sub-iterations for the 1st and 2nd order predictor-corrector schemes (a value around 4 is recommended). • 13: Leo Postma for tidal flats, • 14: explicit N-scheme for tidal flats. Default values for SCHEME FOR ADVECTION OF K-EPSILON = 5 + SCHEME OPTION FOR ADVECTION OF K-EPSILON = 4 give LIPS scheme. Old default value = 1 (characteristics) until version V8P0.'
/
